I've installed debian linux on a Sun Fire V100 and maybe also a V120 (i'm 
not sure, it was a customers machine, i believe the only diference is 
the CPU speed).

I had some troubles with an older installer, with kernel 2.4 and 2.6. One 
didn't recognize the network card and the other had some other problems.

A newer installer solved the problems and now it's running perfectly 
with kernel 2.4.30 since april 2005, uptime is 239 days.

HTH
